OL,3,AAndrew called to give evidence in fraud
OL,4,Atrial in December
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndrew Mountbatten-Windsor has been
OL,7,Fserved with a summons compelling him to
OL,8,Fgive evidence in a fraud trial in the
OL,9,FHigh Court on or around 15 December,
OL,10,Fthe BBC understands.
OL,12,FThe witness summons will see him giving
OL,13,Fevidence and taking questions, in a
OL,14,Fcase in which a wealthy woman alleges
OL,15,Fshe was cheated by her former financial
OL,16,Fadviser.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
