OL,3,AAndrew called to give evidence in fraud
OL,4,Atrial in December
OL,5,
OL,6,FMountbatten-Windsor is not accused of
OL,7,Fwrongdoing, but he could face difficult
OL,8,Fquestions about his financial
OL,9,Farrangements as it is said that he was
OL,10,Fin receipt of some of the disputed
OL,11,Fpayments, including a transfer to him
OL,12,Fof #750,000.
OL,14,FHis court appearance will be the first
OL,15,Fpublic questioning Mountbatten-Windsor
OL,16,Fhas faced since his BBC Newsnight
OL,17,Finterview in 2019.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
